Emberveil is derived from Vengeance (https://github.com/Grey-007/vengeance)
by Grey-007, which is also MIT licensed. The original palette, terminal/Zed/GTK
file layout and the general structure of this theme come from that project; the
palette values, the selection treatment and the border gradient were reworked
for this theme.

Neovim support targets ashen.nvim (https://github.com/ficcdaf/ashen.nvim), used
as a separate dependency and not redistributed as part of this theme.

The bundled wallpaper, backgrounds/BG2.webp, was generated with AI image tools
(ChatGPT and Gemini) and is released under the same MIT license as the theme. It
was veiled and re-encoded for this theme but is otherwise unmodified in content.

Third-party components referenced by this theme remain under their own licenses
and are not distributed here.
